#: website/public/index.html:228
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"Ask your coding agent about an app, a game or a website. REA gives it the "
"tools to inspect the code behind the answer."
msgstr "向你的编程助手提一个关于应用、游戏或网站的问题。REA 为它提供工具，让它检查答案背后的代码。"

#: website/public/index.html:233
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "开始使用"

