msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}你的程式設計助手"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:237
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:259
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:287
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:409
